Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make it my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The great end of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight if you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,achieve
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, little people, are\Nyou guys ready to wreck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:03:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This factory made you\Ndon't tell to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to collect your payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, little bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of this is in your hands, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Send the rescue team over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's injured people! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:03:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Half moon flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiddos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you had it up\Nto here with me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to all the big talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I\Nwas just a gifted matador
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,whose name sends ripples\Nthrough the stadium?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been the strongest\Ncompetitor at one point,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but that wasn't meant to last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I astound all while\Nslaying the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The current hero of the Coliseum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,is the brilliant Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I\Nwas just a gifted matador?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The title means nothing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fame can be evasive, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been running\Naround the kingdom all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you gotta protect your daughter\Nand the ground's all wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Life's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're a day late\Nand a leg short, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone would be at the limit by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would patronize me for my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to use that as an excuse,\NI would then have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I take great pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a small sacrifice\Nfor the man who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, I won't feel guilty\Nabout attacking your weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't be any fun for me to utterly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,crush you while you\Nneed your nappy whappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we pass the\Ntime with the game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the last showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Confetti? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,paper, no, I wonder what\Nthe mystery item could be,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and now for my next\Ntrick, ripple, release.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,spiky metal balls—look at\Nthe breathtaking sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like falling stardust, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no place to hide,\NRobin—protect Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in danger too, commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not waste concern on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great view the last one you'll see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to boast, but my stardust\Ncan wipe out an entire army,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's nearly impossible to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to survive Luckily, we are in this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meal fluid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bad you're not under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Death and hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blower Umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kittles, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Any army that would fall through\Nthis trickery surely lacks training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you smacking my\Nstardust away mid-air?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you also walk through\Nrain without getting wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky's falling, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you wouldn't have stumbled if you\Nstill had that extra leg right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this to him! Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay under the canopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive\Nyou for this, Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then don't forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come make me pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a bullet for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like your mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please unhand me, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to kill this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how much more the\NFlower Umbrella can withstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower your weapon right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Rebecca, this is my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years, you have suffered\Non your own. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For ten years, you've\Nupheld your mother's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother told me I should never\Nhurt others, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must protect yourself\Nfrom those who would hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca has never once wounded anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, she's won every buck just by\Nletting her foes fall off the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You only win by disqualification!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chance of blood, you weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a huge coward! Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of your victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way a gladiator\Nshould claim glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you get stabbed this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a descendant of evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you fought in the coliseum,\Nyou still haven't harmed a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,your hands are still clean they're\Nuntainted your mother's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,reside in those pristine hands
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,mother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so i will not allow for you to\Nstain them with this lousy's blood
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from now on you will\Nlive your life peacefully
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you solid steel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is proof that I am human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing compared to\Nthe grief of being forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Skirtlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, why did you wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've been erased\Nfrom everyone's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.32,0:12:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,These useless tin arms of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even feel your\Nwarmth one last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to\Ngrasp the unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,ache of being unable to\Nfeel anything you touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to all the despicable acts you\Ncommitted against the people of Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,what I suffer now is scarcely pain at all
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm sure that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,anything and I am this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,kingdom solid rage\Nmanifested here to collect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,were in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,your prime two decades?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have peaked by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overlook my sword skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready to call the curtains yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you to your grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my metal rain cleared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's more fitting\Nif I finish you off myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I did with Scarlet, and\NI bet you miss her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So cruel he keeps taunting them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,laughing about scarlet's death,\Nlike rubbing salt in a wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, king Rick;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,our searches ended in vain—a man\Nnamed diamante got ahead of our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,party
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet was found in the town,\Nbut she was killed by gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Scarlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your older sister, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame she had to go\Nand buy food at the market today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If she could have controlled her\Nhunger, she wouldn't have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a greedy sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jake, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't act in haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must think rationally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stay in the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your own protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how this ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My next strike is strong\Nenough to shatter the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Think that wounded leg can dodge\Nwhat I am about to throw at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna avoid my attack,\Nthen you're just a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm taking our peace back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Half moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Treno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Robiland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:17:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you need to get patched up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not save your mother's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll devote mine to protect\Nyours, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, happiness will return to\Nyou. Until then, I'll stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He defeated Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He took down someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is Kiros, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he still live?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros is injured, but safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.18,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And Rebecca, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to Nico\NRobin that she survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable that he took out\Nthe top Don Quixote executives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Coliseum Hero at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have forgotten that Kiros\Nwas the original undefeated champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We truly thought the Don\NQuixote family was invincible,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but here they are dropping\None after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He did well that's our commander
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the tables are turning\Nin our favor at last
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The warriors recruited by\Nthis Straw Hat pirates have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,taken down the lower-ranking\Nexecutives one after another
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only four major players\Nof the Don Quixote family left
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy the hyena, then two high-ranking\Nexecutives, Pika, and Treble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, only the current king and\Nwarlord of the sea, Doflamingo, remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.08,0:20:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our final hurdle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought they'd get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.44,0:20:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These Straw Hat people are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we tried\Nto kill these magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,bastards in an attempt to save ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no use crying\Nover spilt milk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, you guys are saying\Nsuch nice stuff about us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Old King Rick, where are\Nyou going, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not believe my life\Nis threatened any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.58,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is still much left to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to escort you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have very little faith in\Nthe government or the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's feeling helpless right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They think there's no escaping\Nthe sick game or the birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spread a message of\Nhope throughout the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we have finally captured\Nwhat one would call a breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did that one\NNavy admiral guy go anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not take note, Sir Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That decorated fellow traveled\Ninto town a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, gather up all the\Ncivilians you can to one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Make certain it's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep them all safe. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Zoro had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Diamante!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.72,0:22:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real bad look for a\Ntop executive in our family!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As foreseen, I did not come here\Nfor a mere one-on-one skirmish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as an enemy\Nstands, the fight persists.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is old King Rick worth\Na squat to you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, isn't he the reason\Nwhy everybody hates you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you respect that puke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.26,0:23:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You despicable people framed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My father-in-law is my personal savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed benevolence\Nto this young ruffian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rick bloodline upheld\Na reputation for being
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,a family that understood\Nthe value of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.02,0:23:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our richness came from\Nroutine joys, clear skies,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,thriving blossoms, a\Nkingdom of gentle hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the backbone on\Nwhich we flourished.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our entire nation wishes for your wicked
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,family's swift removal\Nso he may reign again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.84,0:24:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.75,0:24:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.26,0:24:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.17,0:24:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That scared the crap out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pika escaped to the third level.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.64,0:24:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Nknock the snot out of him
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,when he's scurrying\Naround like a damn mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.08,0:24:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I close in on him, he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.74,0:24:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.08,0:25:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Pika, please have mercy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget we're on your team!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunting the injured, spineless prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've betrayed the family, BB-5!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.02,0:25:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.08,0:25:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Trilestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That big, shrill bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap already!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.02,0:25:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop going after all the wounded people!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.30,0:25:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.18,0:25:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Light stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.78,0:25:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.56,0:25:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Zoro,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a very important someone\Nup on the King's Black Zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:25:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Dressrosa? Thorma!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.50,0:26:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the point, soprano man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from the has-been king\Nand some of his followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.52,0:26:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the samurai and god Usuf are\Non the king's plateau right now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.96,0:26:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I understand correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.28,0:26:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,suddenly the whole kingdom wants to\Nput King Rick back on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.94,0:26:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.56,0:26:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It pisses me off his what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.38,0:26:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphy's the only one worthy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.84,0:27:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that big behemoth headed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa belongs to\Nthe Don Quixote family!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.24,0:27:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna walk! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The statue is moving! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.34,0:27:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez. Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.44,0:27:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Godless bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to kill the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he ditched me\Nall the way back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.40,0:28:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I played right into his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to think fast of what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One quick punch from him and it\Ncould take out the entire plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't think of some\Nway to shut him down,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.96,0:28:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp and that king guy will\Nbe crushed in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.32,0:28:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter, we won't let you\Nget any closer to Lord Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.74,0:28:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.74,0:28:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's controlling the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.84,0:28:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And headed for the King's Plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.06,0:28:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather. Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.28,0:28:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.19,0:28:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.44,0:29:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.82,0:29:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Long distance slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'd have to travel too\Nfar and it'd barely nick him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.98,0:29:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump up and get on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.96,0:29:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.26,0:29:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.06,0:29:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shout out warning Usopp and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.12,0:29:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No chance in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with all the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.06,0:30:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan four.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Call him by transponder snail\Nand tell him hurry up and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, must have dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.50,0:30:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I do manage to\Nget the message out,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.84,0:30:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not enough time for him to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.48,0:30:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash it for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.10,0:30:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.36,0:30:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He has his sights on King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.44,0:30:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not our fight, but this\Nisn't sitting well with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.92,0:30:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.24,0:30:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Snow Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.24,0:30:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary sniper king\Nis on that very plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.18,0:31:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You, rock boy, you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I volunteer my. I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.28,0:31:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,see
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.60,0:31:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,now the pirate hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.08,0:31:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,was a few steps ahead of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.52,0:31:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I saved my King Punch as he advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.72,0:31:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Rick, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, King Punch guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Elisabello, the King of Prodents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd watch your tongue if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.94,0:31:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, trying to\Nshatter him won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.92,0:31:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hit his flesh and blood\Nor else he'll keep coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.08,0:31:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you suggesting then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.18,0:32:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything, just save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.82,0:32:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.92,0:32:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, give me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.42,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan five.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.40,0:32:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly him to the sky and chop him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.52,0:32:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather's up there. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.68,0:33:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey pirate hunter, don't\Nmake me wait too long, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.94,0:33:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Two by four, if you mean\NCommodore—that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever you're the guy\Nthat threw that other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.66,0:33:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,guy like a cannonball, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.18,0:33:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get smashed like a bug, Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.46,0:33:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.12,0:34:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I you want. Face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.36,0:34:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not put my people through\Nany more needless havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.02,0:34:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, it's time to flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.74,0:34:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You must get off the plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has exited.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.88,0:34:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.06,0:34:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola and Tank, lead everyone to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only after me. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.10,0:34:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.86,0:34:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be the only opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.26,0:34:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at peace with my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.34,0:34:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, Tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.32,0:34:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.00,0:35:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what you\Nreally want, I won't complain!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter or Lumbus?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.52,0:35:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're certain you wish to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.56,0:35:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This technique is not meant\Nfor throwing someone safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, carnivore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just throw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.70,0:35:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard is only going after those\Nwho won't fight back. You ready? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick, you're no king.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna have to lead anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.54,0:35:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.72,0:35:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't run, neither will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We stand with King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.48,0:36:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.56,0:36:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your sheep forgive you for\Nthat decade-long misunderstanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How's a pacifist like you\Ngonna protect your kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even save\Nyour own reputation, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.06,0:36:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A kingdom's strength lies\Nin its military might.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.16,0:36:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing about true authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.36,0:36:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.36,0:36:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.48,0:36:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ZEI!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,KING Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.84,0:36:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The town is going to pulverize me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.08,0:36:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,KILLER!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,BOLING!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.32,0:37:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What you say is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.92,0:37:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I fail to protect my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.94,0:37:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never sit upon that throne again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,However.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.04,0:37:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.56,0:37:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will remain true.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.98,0:37:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine mountains and eight\Nseas make one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One thousand worlds make one Chilliocosm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.82,0:37:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One Chilliocosm to the power of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.78,0:37:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing I can't cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.54,0:37:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style secret technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you naive or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.72,0:37:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If the only means for me to survive\Nis becoming a cold-blooded killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.36,0:37:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then I fearlessly choose death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.10,0:38:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no future for\Na nation of slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.32,0:38:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, we all\Nproudly stand behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.92,0:38:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think so many\Ndo-gooders are lost to history?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.66,0:38:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They always die off for\Nleaving a mark on the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.78,0:38:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The billion-fold world\Nto kill your cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, he's in the top half.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.54,0:39:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rory Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.24,0:39:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.64,0:39:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.54,0:39:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.74,0:39:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like his real body is shifting\Nto one of the newly sliced pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.60,0:40:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And every time I split him,\Nthe other side dies off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.06,0:40:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he's up here, he\Ncan't burrow in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.38,0:40:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out! Peek up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.22,0:40:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going\Nto keep hiding from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.12,0:41:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Soap by cornering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.80,0:41:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You must think you've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.66,0:41:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cut some stones\Nand you can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck cutting\Nthrough my Haki, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.34,0:41:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A Haki user?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.18,0:41:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I pound you into the\Nground, it's all over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.08,0:41:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more time to\Nwaste on a pebble like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.62,0:41:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.06,0:41:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine mountains and eight seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.76,0:41:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can't cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.74,0:41:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.72,0:41:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uranoa, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.80,0:41:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.16,0:42:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now quit picking on the innocent, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.18,0:42:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What an upstanding guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.50,0:42:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.98,0:42:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He really did it, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved my friend, Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His remains are still falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.38,0:42:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.16,0:42:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescue me! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.54,0:42:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your cue!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.54,0:42:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.42,0:42:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,King Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.44,0:43:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you tricking me into using\Nthe king punch for custodial labor!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.40,0:43:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this,\Nyou disrespectful punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.90,0:43:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles that?
